{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jack of All Trades</strong><br>The latest technologies have sped up production, but someone has to maintain them. Fires, broken gears, steam leaks, and countless other problems await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Rest for the Wicked</strong><br>Breakdowns happen constantly. You can\u2019t afford to lose focus for even a second\u2014a broken factory doesn\u2019t generate profit, and the bosses won\u2019t tolerate that. To keep your job as an engineer, you must keep the factory running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Factory Must Grow</strong><br>The plant is enormous, and as an engineer, you\u2019ll gradually unlock new sections of it. Each day, you\u2019ll climb the career ladder and gain access to more factory departments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alternate History</strong><br>As you play, you\u2019ll learn not only about your workplace but also about the game\u2019s world. Here, history took a different turn\u2014instead of inventing electricity, humanity focused on advancing steam technology, and the harsh conditions of industrialization leave workers no time to rest.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3922880?t=1767111546","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3922880?t=1767111546","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922880/22022e1029bcf78fd5a209feaabfb167b42f19f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767111546","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922880/22022e1029bcf78fd5a209feaabfb167b42f19f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767111546","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jack of All Trades</strong><br>The latest technologies have sped up production, but someone has to maintain them. Fires, broken gears, steam leaks, and countless other problems await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Rest for the Wicked</strong><br>Breakdowns happen constantly. You can\u2019t afford to lose focus for even a second\u2014a broken factory doesn\u2019t generate profit, and the bosses won\u2019t tolerate that. To keep your job as an engineer, you must keep the factory running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Factory Must Grow</strong><br>The plant is enormous, and as an engineer, you\u2019ll gradually unlock new sections of it. Each day, you\u2019ll climb the career ladder and gain access to more factory departments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alternate History</strong><br>As you play, you\u2019ll learn not only about your workplace but also about the game\u2019s world. Here, history took a different turn\u2014instead of inventing electricity, humanity focused on advancing steam technology, and the harsh conditions of industrialization leave workers no time to rest.</p>","developers":["JDF GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922880/8dd372f5746c22b2792515f7c3249b744fbca89b/header.jpg?t=1767111546","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"SteamPanic: Last Shift","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium Dual CPU E2180 2.00GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 650<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</